OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CToday:FA frosty start for most, and    
OL,6,Fpatches of valley fog which will lift  
OL,7,Fthrough the morning. Dry, with long    
OL,8,Fsunny spells in the north and cloudy   
OL,9,Fintervals elsewhere. Feeling chilly    
OL,10,Falong the coasts and colder inland.    
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy intervals, especially  
OL,13,Fover the hills with spells of drizzle. 
OL,14,FBreezy and cold, with a touch of rural 
OL,15,Ffrost in the north. Rain in the        
OL,16,Fsouthwest later.                       
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
