OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CSunday:FMostly cloudy, and with        
OL,6,Fpersistent rain in the south. The best 
OL,7,Fof the sunshine will be in the north.  
OL,8,FFeeling cold, especially given the     
OL,9,Fbrisk breeze.                          
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCalm  
OL,12,Fwith cloud dimming the sunshine on     
OL,13,FMonday. On Tuesday, breezy with spells 
OL,14,Fof rain. Calmer on Wednesday but with  
OL,15,Ffurther intervals of rain and cloud.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
